Third-party fingerprint corpora shipped with ping++

1. Rapid7 Recog XML (fingerprints/recog/)
   License: BSD-3-Clause
   Source: https://github.com/rapid7/recog
   See fingerprints/recog/NOTICE

2. Wappalyzer technology signatures (fingerprints/wappalyzer/technologies.json)
   This tree ships a reduced signature subset used only for HTTP product
   matching. Upstream Wappalyzer is MIT-licensed.
   Source: https://github.com/wappalyzer/wappalyzer

ping++ itself does not claim the entire Recog git tree or a complete
Wappalyzer dataset. See docs/prototype-known-gaps.md R11.
